+
--
      * Let `parameterTypeIR` be <<type_of_parameterIR, the type of  `parameterIR`>>.
--
+
for each `parameterIR` in `parameterIR^{asterisk}^`
  ... Let `TC~3~` be `<<add_parameters_t, $add_parameters_t(LOCAL, TC~2~, parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^)>>`.
  ... Let `cid` be `<<cid, $cid(name, parameterList)>>`.
  ... Let `externFunctionTypeDefIR` be `EXTERN_FUNCTION < tid~expl~^{asterisk}^ , tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ > ( parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^ ) : typeIR~ret~`.
  ... Check that <<CallableTypeDef_wf, `externFunctionTypeDefIR` is a well-formed type, assuming bound type ids `$bound(GLOBAL, TC~0~)`>>.
