  ... Check that <<CallableTypeDef_wf, `callableTypeDefIR` is a well-formed type, assuming bound type ids `$bound(GLOBAL, TC~0~)`>>.
  ... Let `cid` be `<<cid_, $cid_(name, constructorParameterListOpt)>>`.
