+
for each `parameterIR` in `parameterIR^{asterisk}^`
  ... Let `TC~3~` be `<<add_parameters_t, $add_parameters_t(BLOCK, TC~2~, parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^)>>`.
  ... Let `controlLocalDeclaration^{asterisk}^` be <<flatten_controlLocalDeclarationList, the list of control local declarations in `controlLocalDeclarationList`>>.
  ... Let `TC~4~` and `controlLocalDeclarationIR^{asterisk}^` be the result of <<ControlLocalDecls_ok, typing `controlLocalDeclaration^{asterisk}^`, under typing context `TC~3~`>>.
