--
+
for each `parameterTypeIR~aligned~` in `parameterTypeIR~aligned~^{asterisk}^`
   .... Let `typeIR~ret_inferred~` be `<<subst_typeIR, $subst_typeIR(inference, typeIR~ret~)>>`.
   .... Let `externMethodTypeIR~inferred~` be `EXTERN_METHOD ( parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~^{asterisk}^ ) : typeIR~ret_inferred~`.
   .... Check that <<CallableType_wf, `externMethodTypeIR~inferred~` is a well-formed type, assuming bound type ids `$bound(p, TC)`>>.
