for each `parameterTypeIR~aligned~` in `parameterTypeIR~aligned~^{asterisk}^`
 .. Let `typeIR~object_inferred~` be `<<subst_typeIR, $subst_typeIR(inference, typeIR~object~)>>`.
 .. Let `constructorTypeIR~inferred~` be `CONSTRUCTOR ( parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~^{asterisk}^ ) : typeIR~object_inferred~`.
 .. Check that <<ConstructorType_wf, `constructorTypeIR~inferred~` is a well-formed type, assuming bound type ids `$bound(cursor', TC)`>>.
 .. Check that `<<instantiable, $instantiable(cursor', TC, instctxt, typeIR~object_inferred~)>>`.
 .. Let `argumentIR~cast~^{asterisk}^` be the result of <<Call_convention_ok, checking the calling convention of `argumentIR^{asterisk}^` applied to parameter types `parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~^{asterisk}^`, under cursor `cursor'`, typing context `TC`, and action context `NOACTION`>>.
