relation ExternMethod_inst: `IC~0~` and `externMethodPrototypeIR`


. If let `annotationList typeIR nameIR < typeParameterListIR , typeParameterListIR~inferred~ > ( parameterListIR ) ;` be `externMethodPrototypeIR`:
 .. Group non-abstract:
  ... Let `cid` be `<<cid_IR, $cid_IR(nameIR, parameterListIR)>>`.
  ... Let `externMethodDef` be `EXTERN_METHOD nameIR < typeParameterListIR {pp} typeParameterListIR~inferred~ > ( parameterListIR ) None`.
