. Else let `annotationList ABSTRACT typeIR nameIR < typeParameterListIR , typeParameterListIR~inferred~ > ( parameterListIR ) ;` be `externMethodPrototypeIR`:
 .. Group abstract:
  ... Let `cid` be `<<cid_IR, $cid_IR(nameIR, parameterListIR)>>`.
  ... Let `externMethodDef` be `EXTERN_METHOD ABSTRACT nameIR < typeParameterListIR {pp} typeParameterListIR~inferred~ > ( parameterListIR )`.
  ... Let `IC~1~` be `<<add_callableDef_overload_i, $add_callableDef_overload_i(BLOCK, IC~0~, cid, externMethodDef)>>`.
  ... Result in `IC~1~`.


