 .. Group custom-default-action:
  ... Result in `STO'` and `annotationList constOptIR DEFAULT_ACTION = tableActionReferenceIR ;`.
. Else let `tableCustomPropertyIR` be `tablePropertyIR`:
 .. If let `annotationList constOptIR CUSTOM nameIR = typedExpressionIR ;` be `tableCustomPropertyIR`:
  ... Group custom:
   .... Let `IC~inner~` be `<<enter_path_i, $enter_path_i(IC, nameIR)>>`.
   .... Let <<Expr_inst, `LOCAL IC~inner~ STO' |- typedExpressionIR : STO~1~ value`>>.
   .... Result in `STO~1~` and `annotationList constOptIR CUSTOM_CONST nameIR = value ;`.
 .. Else let `annotationList constOptIR CUSTOM_CONST nameIR constantInitializerIR ;` be `tableCustomPropertyIR`:
  ... Group custom-const:
   .... Result in `STO'` and `annotationList constOptIR CUSTOM_CONST nameIR constantInitializerIR ;`.


