. If `controlLocalDeclarationIR^{asterisk}^` is an empty list:
 .. Group nil:
  ... Result in `IC'`, `STO'`, and `[ ]`.
. Else let `controlLocalDeclarationIR~h~ {two-colons} controlLocalDeclarationIR~t~^{asterisk}^` be `controlLocalDeclarationIR^{asterisk}^`:
 .. Group cons-none:
  ... Let <<ControlLocalDecl_inst, `IC' STO' |- controlLocalDeclarationIR~h~ : IC~1~ STO~1~ controlLocalDeclarationIR'^?^`>>.
