relation Expr_eval: `p`, `EC'`, `STO'`, and <<typedExpressionIR, `expressionIR` annotated with `++_++`>>


. If let `booleanLiteral` be `expressionIR`:
 .. Group literalExpressionIR-boolean:
  ... If `booleanLiteral` matches pattern `TRUE`:
   .... Let `expressionResult` be `B true`.
   .... Result in the resulting evaluation context `EC'`, store `STO'` and expression result `expressionResult`.
  ... Else `booleanLiteral` matches pattern `FALSE`:
   .... Let `expressionResult` be `B false`.
