. Else if let `integerLiteral` be `expressionIR`:
 .. Group literalExpressionIR-number:
  ... If let `D i` be `integerLiteral`:
   .... Let `expressionResult` be `D i`.
   .... Result in the resulting evaluation context `EC'`, store `STO'` and expression result `expressionResult`.
  ... Else if let `n W i` be `integerLiteral`:
   .... Let `expressionResult` be `n W i`.
