    ..... Let <<Copy_out, `STO~2~ p EC~2~ parameterIR~aligned~^{asterisk}^ @ LOCAL EC~callee_3~ (storageReference^?^)^{asterisk}^ ~> EC~3~`>>.
    ..... Result in the resulting evaluation context `EC~3~`, store `STO~2~`, and call result `RETURN None`.
. Else if let `definedFunctionCallee` be `callee`:
 .. Group definedFunctionCallee:
  ... Let `FUNCTION nameIR < typeParameterListIR > ( parameterIR^{asterisk}^ # id~default~^{asterisk}^ ) blockStatementIR` be `definedFunctionCallee`.
