  ... Let <<Copy_in, `STO~0'~ p EC~0'~ parameterIR~aligned~^{asterisk}^ @ LOCAL EC~callee_0~ argumentIR~aligned~^{asterisk}^ ~> STO~1~ EC~1~ @ EC~callee_1~ # copyInListResult`>>.
