for each `parameterIR` in `parameterIR^{asterisk}^`
  ... Let `EC~callee_5~`, `STO~2~`, and `callResult` be the result of <<ExternMethodCall_eval, calling an extern method `oid``nameIR` on object `STO~1~`, under evaluation context `EC~callee_4~`, and store `nameIR~param~^{asterisk}^`>>.
