  ... Let `EC~callee_1~` be `EC~callee_0~[BLOCK.FRAME = frame][BLOCK.CALLABLE = { (cid : actionDef)^{asterisk}^ }]`.
  ... Else if let `(storageReference^?^)^{asterisk}^` be `copyInListResult`:
