relation Expr_eval_keyset_simple: `EC~0'~`, `STO~0'~`, and `simpleKeysetExpressionIR`


. Check that `simpleKeysetExpressionIR` has type `typedExpressionIR`.
. Let `typedExpressionIR` be `simpleKeysetExpressionIR`.
. Group typedExpressionIR:
 .. Let `EC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `expressionResult` be the result of <<Expr_eval, evaluating `typedExpressionIR`, under cursor `LOCAL`, evaluation context `EC~0'~`, and store `STO~0'~`>>.
 .. If let `exitResult` be `expressionResult`:
  ... Result in `EC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `EXIT`.
 .. Else let `value` be `expressionResult`:
  ... Check that `value` has type `setValue`.
  ... Let `setValue` be `value`.
  ... Result in `EC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `setValue`.
. If let `typedExpressionIR~l~ &&& typedExpressionIR~r~` be `simpleKeysetExpressionIR`:
 .. Group mask:
  ... Let `EC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `expressionResult` be the result of <<Expr_eval, evaluating `typedExpressionIR~l~`, under cursor `LOCAL`, evaluation context `EC~0'~`, and store `STO~0'~`>>.
  ... If let `exitResult` be `expressionResult`:
   .... Result in `EC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `EXIT`.
  ... Else let `value~l~` be `expressionResult`:
   .... Let `EC~2~`, `STO~2~`, and `expressionResult'` be the result of <<Expr_eval, evaluating `typedExpressionIR~r~`, under cursor `LOCAL`, evaluation context `EC~1~`, and store `STO~1~`>>.
   .... If let `exitResult` be `expressionResult'`:
    ..... Result in `EC~2~`, `STO~2~`, and `EXIT`.
   .... Else let `value~r~` be `expressionResult'`:
    ..... Let `setValue` be `SET { value~l~ &&& value~r~ }`.
    ..... Result in `EC~2~`, `STO~2~`, and `setValue`.
. Else if let `typedExpressionIR~l~ .. typedExpressionIR~r~` be `simpleKeysetExpressionIR`:
 .. Group range:
  ... Let `EC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `expressionResult` be the result of <<Expr_eval, evaluating `typedExpressionIR~l~`, under cursor `LOCAL`, evaluation context `EC~0'~`, and store `STO~0'~`>>.
  ... If let `exitResult` be `expressionResult`:
   .... Result in `EC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `EXIT`.
  ... Else let `value~l~` be `expressionResult`:
   .... Let `EC~2~`, `STO~2~`, and `expressionResult'` be the result of <<Expr_eval, evaluating `typedExpressionIR~r~`, under cursor `LOCAL`, evaluation context `EC~1~`, and store `STO~1~`>>.
   .... If let `exitResult` be `expressionResult'`:
    ..... Result in `EC~2~`, `STO~2~`, and `EXIT`.
   .... Else let `value~r~` be `expressionResult'`:
    ..... Let `setValue` be `SET { value~l~ .. value~r~ }`.
    ..... Result in `EC~2~`, `STO~2~`, and `setValue`.
. Group default-any:
 .. If `simpleKeysetExpressionIR` matches pattern `DEFAULT`:
  ... Let `setValue` be `SET { ... }`.
  ... Result in `EC~0'~`, `STO~0'~`, and `setValue`.
 .. Else if `simpleKeysetExpressionIR` matches pattern `_`:
  ... Let `setValue` be `SET { ... }`.
  ... Result in `EC~0'~`, `STO~0'~`, and `setValue`.


