 .. Let `EC~1~`, `STO~1~`, and `statementResult` be the result of <<Stmt_eval, the compile-time evaluation of `callableTargetIR < [ ] > ( argumentIR^{asterisk}^ ) ;`, under cursor `GLOBAL`, evaluation context `EC~0~`, and store `STO~0~`>>.
 .. Else if let `rejectTransitionResult` be `statementResult`:
